supportingObject (
    installationMessages {
        welcome:
            ```
            Installs the shared XXFND_ database objects (security, flexfields, attachments, workflow), the common seed data and the first administrator into the parsing schema (XXFUSION).
            ```
        confirmation:
            ```
            The first script checks the schema's privileges; if one is missing it stops with the exact statements to run as ADMIN (see INSTALL.md in the install pack).
            Install the database objects now? Existing XXFND_ tables are upgraded instead of recreated.
            ```
        installSuccess:
            ```
            Installed. You are the first Common Administrator.
            ```
        installFailure:
            ```
            Installation failed. If script 00a Prerequisites check failed (ORA-20900 ACTION NEEDED), its message lists the statements to run as ADMIN: run them, then come back and Install Supporting Objects again (Utilities > Supporting Objects). Otherwise check the script results, fix the cause and reinstall; every script can be re-run.
            ```
    }
    upgrade {
        upgradeWhenSqlQuery:
            ```sql
            select null from user_tables where table_name = 'XXFND_LOOKUP_TYPES'
            ```
    }
    upgradeMessages {
        welcome:
            ```
            Upgrades the shared packages, views and seed data. Tables and data are kept.
            ```
        success:
            ```
            Upgrade complete.
            ```
    }
)
